recognition models and their character dictionary, unmodified, in the ONNX
conversion RapidOCR publishes (source, version and SHA-256 in
ocr/models/MODELS.md). They are built into ethos-parser-ocr, the recognizer
behind --ocr, which each release archive carries beside ethos-parser.

  PaddleOCR: Copyright (c) 2016 PaddlePaddle Authors. Apache License 2.0.
  RapidOCR:  Copyright (c) 2021 RapidOCR Authors. Apache License 2.0.

The licence text is ./LICENSE. Neither project's repository carries a NOTICE
file (checked 2026-11-14), so there is no further notice to reproduce.
ocr/vendor/rten-vecmath is rten-vecmath 0.26.0 (MIT OR Apache-2.0, used here
under Apache-2.0), with the changes recorded in
ocr/vendor/rten-vecmath/ETHOS-PATCH.md.

